From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: RCT Screensaver <noreply@example.invalid>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 19:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Screensaver: export and import playlist bundles through the
 system's file dialog

screensaver.exportPlaylist(sequence) shows the system's Save dialog for a
playlist bundle (a .zip) and runs the registered generator with
--live-export <sequence> --to <file> in the background.
screensaver.importPlaylist() shows the Open dialog and runs it with
--live-import <file>, which unpacks the bundle into the user's folder and
builds it. Both return false when the dialog is closed. The game shows the
dialog and passes the picked file to the generator: a plugin never names a
path. One task (build, export or import) runs at a time; buildStatus gains
`task`.

applyBuild(sequence) now also takes a sequence that is not playing (a
playlist just imported): it is copied into its installed folder, or a new
one in the user's sequence folder, the sequences are scanned again and it
starts playing.
